+                <b>Look before you pay for photos.</b> Only call <C>/images</C> when <C>image_count</C> is above 0.
+              </li>
+              <li>
+                <b>Watch your balance.</b> <C>meta.credits_remaining</C> comes with every answer, and <C>/v1/usage</C> is free.
